/-- S88 trig-free rung (mirror of S86 `85/86` rung, banked S86 base):
`S₈₈ = S₈₆ + 87^{-s} - 88^{-s}` at `sCenter`.
* Log bridges: `87 = 29 * 3` (mirror of `CS_log_eightysix_eq`, uses `CS_log_twentynine`
  + `CS_log_three`); `88 = 44 * 2` (mirror of `CS_log_eightysix_eq`, uses
  `CS_log_fortyfour` + `CS_log2`).
* Phase bridges `φ₈₇`, `φ₈₈` (`6.75 * log`).
* Rpow: `87^0.395 ≥ 4.01`, `88^0.395 ≥ 4.01` via quadratic lower (mirrors of
  `CS_rpow85/86pos_lower_proved`); hence `r₈₇ ≤ 0.34`
  (`0.34·4.01 = 1.3634 ≥ 1`), `r₈₈ ≤ 0.34` (same product)
  (reciprocal steps).
* Cpow Re/Im splits for `87^{-s}`, `88^{-s}` (token mirrors of
  `CS_cpow85/86_sCenter_re/im` with `Complex.exp_re/im` + `cos/sin`).
* Re caps trig-free: `Re₈₇ ≥ -0.34` (`-1 ≤ cos`); `Re₈₈ ≤ 0.34`
  (`cos ≤ 1`). No phase-aware improvement (see gap below).
* Assembly Re: `Re(S₈₈) = Re(S₈₆) + Re₈₇ - Re₈₈ ≥ -23.68 - 0.34 - 0.34
  = -24.36` (honest trig-free regression vs S86 `-23.68` by `0.68`; trails live best
  `slow = 1.94`).
* Im caps trig-free: `Im₈₇ ≥ -0.34`, `Im₈₈ ≤ 0.34`; link
  `Im(S₈₈) = Im(S₈₆) + Im₈₇ - Im₈₈`; conditional on explicit `S₈₆` premise
  (mirror of `CS_complex_S86_Im_ge_of_S84`, tail width `0.68`); unconditional
  `≥ -27.08 - 0.34 - 0.34 = -27.76` by chaining banked S86 `-27.08`
  (`CS_complex_S86_Im_ge_neg2708`). Reuses banked S86 bases; no S84 rebuild. -/

