Mirror of the S112 rung (S110 → S112), reusing banked S112 bases; no S110 rebuild.
* Log bridges `log 113 = log 100 + log(113/100)`, `log 114 = log 100 +
  log(114/100)` (mirrors of `CS_log_hundredeleven_eq` / `CS_log_hundredtwelve_eq`,
  reuses banked `CS_log_hundred_ge/le`; ratio windows `log(113/100) ∈
